/* THE Default Profile

   This profile is executed when THE starts up.
   It contains a few sensible defaults and key bindings.
*/

/* Bind F4 and Shift-Tab to move the cursor to the prefix area. */
/* This is particularly useful on macOS where the Home key can be tricky. */
'define f4 cursor prefix'
'define s-tab cursor home save'
'define backspace sos delback'

/* Display a startup message */
'msg Welcome to THE (The Hessling Editor) - CREXX Edition'